OPE TSI: 4.2.2.5.2, 4.2.2.7.2""" ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf :length,
        :platformDataParameter ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" ;
    skos:scopeNote """Platform dimensions are always related to one neighbouring track at a time.
So, if two tracks are along a platform, this platform should be divided into two RINF platforms to have precise description of each."""@en .

