    rdfs:isDefinedBy : ;
    rdfs:range xsd:double ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf :performanceDataParameter ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" ;
    skos:scopeNote """Normaal Amsterdams Peil (NAP), called also Amsterdam Ordnance Datum, it is a vertical datum commonly in use in Europe as reference level for the description of the height of objects in relation to the sea level.

The value of the parameter shall be given in metres, with tolerance of +/-100m."""@en .

